WEBVTT

00:08.775 --> 00:16.816
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.816 --> 00:24.814
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.332 --> 00:36.136
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.136 --> 00:39.139
Believing, dreaming

00:39.139 --> 00:42.976
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:42.976 --> 00:48.107
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.916 --> 00:58.324
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.324 --> 01:02.896
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.896 --> 01:05.565
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.565 --> 01:13.840
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.840 --> 01:18.800
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.346 --> 01:26.979
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:34.360 --> 01:37.964
While with an eye made quiet by the power

01:37.964 --> 01:40.733
Of harmony, and the deep power of joy

01:40.733 --> 01:42.997
We see into the life of things.

01:43.736 --> 01:46.705
Goodnight, Father.

01:58.518 --> 02:00.042
Hel...

02:00.587 --> 02:02.680
She was smiling, wasn't she?

02:04.023 --> 02:04.819
Yeah.

02:05.458 --> 02:08.018
Then I guess it was okay, huh?

02:17.337 --> 02:19.464
The fated hour has come.

02:24.144 --> 02:26.704
We're going back, aren't we, Loki?

02:29.149 --> 02:31.947
Back to our own world.

02:33.853 --> 02:39.587
The 26th Night
The Gods Depart

03:03.850 --> 03:06.080
I've put things in order downstairs.

03:06.386 --> 03:08.513
Did you? Good work.

03:09.522 --> 03:11.922
So we can really return to the
world of the gods, then?

03:12.759 --> 03:15.751
Would you like to stay in this
world a little longer?

03:16.229 --> 03:19.732
No. I merely accompany you, Master Loki.

03:19.732 --> 03:22.132
There's no mail order in our world, you know.

03:22.435 --> 03:24.403
Teasing me again?

03:25.972 --> 03:27.132
Loki!

03:28.274 --> 03:29.172
Mayura...

03:33.746 --> 03:35.441
What's all this?

03:37.550 --> 03:39.780
Yamino! Where's Loki?

03:40.253 --> 03:42.016
Master Loki is out at the moment.

03:42.622 --> 03:44.324
He's gone out, huh?

03:44.324 --> 03:46.053
When will he be back?

03:46.526 --> 03:47.720
I don't know.

03:49.128 --> 03:53.258
What do you mean... you don't know?
He is coming back, isn't he?

03:53.967 --> 03:56.435
He just disappeared all of a sudden.

03:57.103 --> 03:58.738
Disappeared?

03:58.738 --> 04:00.501
Then why aren't you searching for him?

04:02.041 --> 04:03.531
What is this?

04:03.743 --> 04:05.540
Tell me what's going on!

04:06.379 --> 04:09.837
Why are you so calm?
Loki disappeared, right?!

04:10.216 --> 04:11.251
Yes...

04:11.251 --> 04:12.878
Then we've gotta search for him!

04:13.086 --> 04:14.087
No.

04:14.087 --> 04:16.214
What's with you?

04:16.623 --> 04:19.259
What's with you?!
I don't get any of this!

04:19.259 --> 04:22.194
He might be back someday.

04:22.662 --> 04:24.330
"Someday"?!

04:24.330 --> 04:27.458
When is that?! Today? Tomorrow?

04:27.900 --> 04:29.367
Yamino!

04:31.271 --> 04:33.569
Fine! I'll go search for him!

04:41.881 --> 04:42.973
Master Loki!

04:43.349 --> 04:44.543
Daddy...

04:46.085 --> 04:50.818
If we do return to the world of the gods,
will Master Loki have anyplace to go to?

04:53.660 --> 04:55.762
Idiot! What are you talking about?

04:55.762 --> 04:58.998
Our old man's gonna take out Odin
and become ruler of our world!

04:58.998 --> 05:00.465
It's obvious!

05:02.535 --> 05:05.663
The ruler of the world of the gods, you say?

05:10.243 --> 05:11.608
Miss Reiya.

05:12.011 --> 05:14.280
How are you feeling, milady?

05:14.280 --> 05:16.612
I'm all right, Mino.

05:16.916 --> 05:22.055
I'm just a little warm, that's all.
I'll feel better if I get some sleep.

05:22.055 --> 05:25.892
I see. If there's anything you need,
please ring the bell

05:25.892 --> 05:28.326
and I'll be right there.

05:28.795 --> 05:29.796
Okay.

05:29.796 --> 05:32.765
Well then, have a good rest.

05:33.533 --> 05:34.734
Mino?

05:34.734 --> 05:35.860
Milady?

05:37.603 --> 05:39.400
Thank you.

05:40.406 --> 05:42.374
If you'll excuse me.

05:46.179 --> 05:48.281
I can't help thinking...

05:48.281 --> 05:50.950
that we're doing something bad.

05:50.950 --> 05:53.612
Would you stay here as Reiya instead?

06:00.159 --> 06:04.323
The little girl known as Reiya Oshima
is no longer a part of this world.

06:04.931 --> 06:07.934
Reiya will vanish, and it will be as if
all have awakened from a dream.

06:07.934 --> 06:09.731
That's all there is to it.

06:10.403 --> 06:11.870
A dream, huh?

06:12.305 --> 06:15.103
Come. Let's go, Freya.

06:15.575 --> 06:16.701
Right.

06:23.449 --> 06:24.848
Her memories?

06:27.053 --> 06:32.286
Verdandi, can't you do something
using your alchemy?

06:33.726 --> 06:36.024
There is nothing I cannot do.

06:36.929 --> 06:39.625
But whose memories do you wish to erase?

06:41.968 --> 06:43.162
Mayura.

06:46.305 --> 06:50.977
I'd like to have all her
memories of us erased.

06:50.977 --> 06:53.946
It would be for her own sake.

06:55.348 --> 06:56.679
Lord Loki...

06:57.316 --> 06:59.910
Can I count on you, Verdandi?

07:02.522 --> 07:04.888
Very well. I will do it.

07:06.259 --> 07:07.726
Thank you.

07:15.902 --> 07:19.531
Loki will probably never forgive Odin, huh?

07:21.240 --> 07:23.538
We're going to eat these
all up, Gullinbursti!

07:25.211 --> 07:28.009
There's no reason to stuff
yourselves like that!

07:28.347 --> 07:31.184
Put a lid on it, Heimdall!

07:31.184 --> 07:35.018
I don't want to have any lingering
regrets about this world!

07:36.556 --> 07:39.425
Frey, if you're going to have any
regrets about this world,

07:39.425 --> 07:41.393
it's not going to be over taiyaki, right?

07:43.129 --> 07:45.927
Go see her, your Japanese beauty.

07:47.266 --> 07:50.670
But if I do, what should I say to her?

07:50.670 --> 07:53.161
You can't bring her back to
the world of the gods.

07:55.641 --> 07:58.804
I don't want to say it.

07:59.212 --> 08:03.740
I don't want to say goodbye
to my Japanese beauty.

08:06.085 --> 08:07.382
Frey...

08:12.959 --> 08:15.757
Loki, where are you?

08:16.095 --> 08:19.223
I still haven't made up with you.

08:20.299 --> 08:21.868
Huh? Daidoji!

08:21.868 --> 08:22.802
Super Spicy Kimchee
Huh? Daidoji!

08:22.802 --> 08:24.531
Super Spicy Kimchee
Narugami?

08:24.837 --> 08:27.635
What's wrong? You don't look so...

08:27.940 --> 08:30.877
Ah, um... I, uh...

08:30.877 --> 08:33.679
Listen, Daidoji, uh...

08:33.679 --> 08:35.237
Ya want some kimchee?!

08:41.487 --> 08:42.954
Thank you.

08:43.823 --> 08:46.951
Then you're sure about this, Lord Loki?

08:48.094 --> 08:49.220
Yeah.

08:54.166 --> 08:57.135
This would be for the best.

09:15.121 --> 09:16.889
I don't know what to say.

09:16.889 --> 09:23.021
I mean, I told you I'd help you look for him,
but I think the Loki you know is already...

09:25.831 --> 09:27.633
What's the matter, Daidoji?

09:27.633 --> 09:29.794
Did you think of someplace
we could look for him?

09:32.371 --> 09:33.706
There is none.

09:33.706 --> 09:34.673
Huh?

09:35.041 --> 09:37.509
There's nowhere we can look for him.

09:40.613 --> 09:46.415
If I think about it, I don't know
a thing about Loki.

09:46.986 --> 09:51.013
So even if I wanted to search for him,
there's nothing that comes to mind.

09:52.258 --> 09:53.725
Daidoji...

09:54.694 --> 09:56.629
I'm kinda like...

09:56.629 --> 09:58.965
Alice in Wonderland in a way.

09:58.965 --> 10:03.669
One morning I wake up and all the
fantastic things are gone.

10:03.669 --> 10:06.536
Loki is gone now, too.

10:07.373 --> 10:10.240
And I don't think I'll ever see him again.

10:14.647 --> 10:18.981
I've felt like this before, long ago...

10:21.220 --> 10:23.017
I'm sorry, Narugami.

10:24.123 --> 10:25.249
Hey!

10:25.925 --> 10:28.894
Sorry! I didn't mean to
interrupt you on the job.

10:28.894 --> 10:31.931
Thanks for your help.
I'll look for him on my own.

10:31.931 --> 10:33.865
Oh. Okay...

10:34.266 --> 10:35.358
See ya!

10:38.938 --> 10:40.565
Daidoji...

10:44.310 --> 10:47.040
Enjaku
Detective
Agency

10:47.113 --> 10:49.138
This is the only place that...

10:52.652 --> 10:54.279
Hello!

10:59.392 --> 11:01.019
Are they all out?

11:11.804 --> 11:15.365
I wonder if he'll get angry at
me again if I just walk in.

11:17.376 --> 11:18.741
Loki?!

11:38.931 --> 11:42.890
I didn't know where else to look.

11:43.302 --> 11:44.599
I see.

11:51.644 --> 11:58.846
If Mayura wears this in her hair,
all her memories of us will vanish.

12:02.054 --> 12:03.180
Um...

12:03.823 --> 12:05.257
What's up?

12:05.257 --> 12:09.193
Um... So how do you know Loki?

12:09.562 --> 12:10.930
Well...

12:10.930 --> 12:12.932
Are you a relative or something?

12:12.932 --> 12:16.060
No. I guess you could say I'm a friend.

12:17.036 --> 12:19.698
A friend? I see...

12:25.277 --> 12:26.746
Well, then.

12:26.746 --> 12:29.306
I'm going to go looking for him.

12:29.715 --> 12:32.752
I don't know where, but for now
I'll just look wherever I can.

12:32.752 --> 12:33.753
Oh?

12:33.753 --> 12:35.988
Well, if you'll excuse me...

12:35.988 --> 12:37.490
Ah! Wait a minute.

12:37.490 --> 12:38.787
Yes?

12:45.231 --> 12:47.927
I wonder if I might be of use.

12:50.069 --> 12:52.503
You do look rather tired...

12:53.539 --> 12:57.839
Thanks, but that's all right.
I appreciate the thought.

12:59.078 --> 13:00.045
One more thing.

13:04.350 --> 13:05.977
I'm a god.

13:10.356 --> 13:11.653
Therefore...

13:12.324 --> 13:15.657
I will grant you one wish.

13:21.033 --> 13:23.001
You're kind of like Loki!

13:24.303 --> 13:28.541
I do like mysteries and the occult and stuff,

13:28.541 --> 13:30.975
but I don't believe in gods.

13:32.611 --> 13:36.048
When I was little, my mother fell ill,

13:36.048 --> 13:42.009
and I prayed every day that
she not be taken away.

13:43.489 --> 13:46.049
But it didn't work.

13:52.932 --> 13:54.559
Excuse me.

14:05.110 --> 14:09.570
I wonder if I'm going to lose another
person who's dear to me.

14:12.885 --> 14:15.285
I don't want that.

14:20.593 --> 14:22.220
I want to see Loki!

14:24.029 --> 14:29.729
I don't believe in gods, but if you can,
please grant this wish!

14:35.274 --> 14:36.741
Mayura...

14:43.749 --> 14:46.452
He's about this tall.

14:46.452 --> 14:48.682
Nah, I haven't seen him.

14:49.555 --> 14:51.216
Is that right?

16:12.304 --> 16:13.532
I...

16:28.153 --> 16:29.421
Daddy!

16:29.421 --> 16:30.581
Master Loki!

16:31.623 --> 16:33.090
We've been waiting for you.

16:40.099 --> 16:41.396
Guys...

16:44.136 --> 16:48.038
I won't be returning to the
world of the gods.

16:52.945 --> 16:54.344
You're not surprised, are you?

16:55.180 --> 17:01.813
Master Loki, do you know why Hel
was able to smile in the end?

17:04.056 --> 17:09.585
I'm not really sure, but I think it was
because she was happy, Daddy.

17:10.396 --> 17:13.866
You're happy when you're with
the people you love,

17:13.866 --> 17:16.596
and you're sad when you're not.

17:18.971 --> 17:21.907
We want to be with you, Master Loki.

17:21.907 --> 17:26.606
We'll be happy anywhere,
if it's where you want to be.

18:00.145 --> 18:02.815
Has Ragnarok been avoided?

18:02.815 --> 18:05.113
We'll find out soon enough.

18:05.784 --> 18:08.912
Yes, it shall be as fate leads us.

18:43.088 --> 18:44.578
Loki...

18:45.090 --> 18:47.558
Loki, I want to see you!

18:49.495 --> 18:51.292
God!

18:53.799 --> 18:55.027
What's the matter?

18:56.034 --> 18:58.025
You're looking pretty glum, Mayura.

19:03.509 --> 19:05.136
What's the big deal?

19:05.677 --> 19:08.475
Don't look at me like you're seeing a ghost!

19:08.914 --> 19:10.506
Loki...

19:19.892 --> 19:21.382
Loki!

19:23.395 --> 19:24.589
Thank goodness...

19:25.397 --> 19:27.592
I'm so glad!

19:30.569 --> 19:31.866
Mayura...

19:44.483 --> 19:48.283
Maybe there really is a god.

20:05.837 --> 20:17.806
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

20:19.484 --> 20:31.230
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

20:31.230 --> 20:38.437
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

20:38.437 --> 20:44.776
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

20:44.776 --> 20:54.286
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

20:54.286 --> 20:58.624
Kizutsuitemo

20:58.624 --> 21:10.636
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

21:10.636 --> 21:12.365
Believe in Heaven

21:22.381 --> 21:25.350
Secret Technique: Takoyaki Galaxy!

21:26.885 --> 21:29.012
Galactic!

21:29.254 --> 21:30.689
Takoyaki
10 pieces
400 yen

21:30.689 --> 21:32.491
Takoyaki
10 pieces
400 yen
You want one helping?

21:32.491 --> 21:35.426
Takoyaki
10 pieces
400 yen
Two, please. I'm going to bring
one back for Loki.

21:35.994 --> 21:38.087
I see. Thanks for the business!

21:38.630 --> 21:39.197
We will predict your future!

21:39.197 --> 21:41.233
Midnight Sun
Fortune Telling
We will predict your future!

21:41.233 --> 21:44.396
Midnight Sun
Fortune Telling
The mysterious secret of the Norse:
Midnight Sun Fortune Telling!

21:46.505 --> 21:49.308
You're overdoing it, Skuld!

21:49.308 --> 21:51.970
And what's with that outfit?

21:52.377 --> 21:54.345
You want me to predict your love life?

21:56.415 --> 21:59.475
I'd like to know how compatible I am
with a certain girl in glasses.

21:59.651 --> 22:00.948
Glasses?

22:02.287 --> 22:04.255
I'd like to change that!

22:04.823 --> 22:08.054
Could you tell me my chances with a
certain beautiful fortuneteller?

22:08.293 --> 22:08.493
Supermarket

22:08.493 --> 22:11.296
Supermarket
This is fabulous!

22:12.664 --> 22:17.363
250 yen for a jumbo pumpkin is the
kind of price you only dream about!

22:18.270 --> 22:21.373
But what are we going to do
with so many of them?!

22:21.373 --> 22:23.542
And why do I have to help you anyway?

22:23.542 --> 22:26.511
Hey, it's the same as always...
right, Heimdall?

22:28.580 --> 22:29.381
Big Sale

22:29.381 --> 22:30.982
Big Sale
Now that I think about it,

22:30.982 --> 22:34.186
Big Sale
the supermarket down the street is
selling daikon radishes at half price.

22:34.186 --> 22:36.455
Big Sale
What?! Why that's amazing!

22:36.455 --> 22:39.291
Big Sale
All right, let's head straight over there.

22:39.291 --> 22:39.825
Big Sale

22:39.825 --> 22:41.019
Big Sale
Right now?!

22:41.493 --> 22:43.195
Enjaku
Detective
Agency

22:43.195 --> 22:45.597
Enjaku
Detective
Agency
We're not getting any cases, are we?

22:45.597 --> 22:47.531
Enjaku
Detective
Agency
You've got that right.

22:47.799 --> 22:51.503
What's wrong with that? I like this.

22:51.503 --> 22:52.868
If you say so.

22:57.142 --> 22:59.269
I'll bet that's your shipment
of shimeji mushrooms.

23:00.679 --> 23:03.348
No, those won't arrive until tomorrow.

23:03.348 --> 23:06.084
So could that mean it's a new client?!

23:06.084 --> 23:07.419
Maybe.

23:07.419 --> 23:09.046
I'll get it!

23:09.621 --> 23:11.316
Well now,

23:12.324 --> 23:14.292
I wonder what kind of case this will be.

23:15.594 --> 23:16.962
It's obvious!

23:16.962 --> 23:19.294
It'll be another strange mystery!

23:20.031 --> 23:22.761
Coming! Just one moment!
